OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant concerns' about care
OL,4,Ahome in Dumfries and Galloway
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors have revealed "significant
OL,7,Fconcerns" about the quality of care
OL,8,Fexperienced by residents at a care home
OL,9,Fin the south-west of Scotland.
OL,11,FThe operator of Munches Park House in
OL,12,FDalbeattie has been ordered to make
OL,13,Fimprovements within six weeks, or it
OL,14,Ffaces closure.
OL,16,FIt has been told to ensure that the
OL,17,Fcare provided meets the needs of
OL,18,Fresidents and that their health and
OL,19,Fwellbeing is being protected.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
