OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant concerns' about care
OL,4,Ahome in Dumfries and Galloway
OL,5,
OL,6,FMunches Park House, which is owned by
OL,7,FPark Homes, is home to a maximum of 30
OL,8,Fpeople, including older people with
OL,9,Fdementia.
